<div class="pol-tldr"><b>the short version</b><ul><li>10-day no-questions-asked returns from the date of delivery</li><li>refunds go back to your original payment method (UPI or card)</li><li>damaged or wrong item? we replace or refund it</li></ul></div>
<h2>our promise</h2>
<p>We want you to love Sleep Well. If you don't, you can ask for a return within <b>10 days of delivery</b>, no questions asked.</p>
<h2>how to request a return or refund</h2>
<ul>
<li>Message us on <a href="https://wa.me/{{ settings.whatsapp_number | remove: ' ' | remove: '+' }}">WhatsApp 95673 09388</a> or email <a href="mailto:{{ settings.support_email }}">{{ settings.support_email }}</a> within 10 days of delivery.</li>
<li>Share your order number (or the phone number/email you ordered with).</li>
<li>We'll confirm the next steps, including how to send the pack back if we need it.</li>
</ul>
<h2>how refunds are paid</h2>
<p>Once your refund is approved, we initiate it to your <b>original payment method</b> (the UPI account or card you paid with) through our payment partner Razorpay. Banks usually take 5–7 working days to show the money in your account after we initiate it.</p>
<h2>damaged, wrong or missing items</h2>
<p>If something arrives damaged, the wrong item is delivered, or part of your order is missing, tell us within 48 hours of delivery with photos. We'll send a replacement or a full refund, your choice.</p>
<h2>cancellations</h2>
<p>Changed your mind before your order ships? Message us and we'll cancel it and refund you in full. Once it has shipped, the return process above applies.</p>
<h2>free gifts and discounts</h2>
<p>Refunds are for the amount you actually paid, after any discount code. Free gifts that came with an order don't need to be returned.</p>
<h2>questions</h2>
<p><a href="https://wa.me/{{ settings.whatsapp_number | remove: ' ' | remove: '+' }}">WhatsApp 95673 09388</a> or email <a href="mailto:{{ settings.support_email }}">{{ settings.support_email }}</a>.</p>
